Apple is planning to hold an "Experience" on March 4 for select members of the media, and in the days before the event, we're expecting several product refreshes. The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-air/">iPad Air</a> is one of the new devices that could get an update, so we thought we'd highlight what's coming.<br/>
<br/>
